      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量交给我们的接力棒，\n我很清楚那是多么热烈，多么珍贵的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42f7334229d2861226406242df9ea54af1bcfc28c4db983bb5e43c84932a503a",
