    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a52fdc0311ab6e1abbaa4ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“这个选择是正确的”。我要证明这一点。\n作为队伍＜斗宿六＞，我们一定会拿下春天的两座后冠冠军。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd1eed905e0cd88968aadc7a2c4e72e7b721b3cac9bbdde956701d6dd7729ca",
