    {
      "uid": "zhcn:125f0baa0d080975e422313b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在莱茵力量面前，假装冷静。\n其实我自己也很久没有参加这么大型的节目了，有些紧张。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5da1ae15f921e3ac7b3e3fe3aa2260da805e0ad7795759184ff9a0c26d9743f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202011.json",
