    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f29a1ec6438bb350c2adda80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我率领的队伍＜斗宿六＞，是从身为知名训练员的父亲那里\n继承来的。与知名赛马娘圣王光环一起重新发展队伍――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d9ad19b8404a115e648f480055caf4e17a107631258aa677ba2fe3a285330c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202011.json",
