      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我率领的队伍＜斗宿六＞，是从身为知名训练员的父亲那里\n继承来的。与知名赛马娘圣王光环一起重新发展队伍――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d9ad19b8404a115e648f480055caf4e17a107631258aa677ba2fe3a285330c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
