      "uid": "zhcn:52b43c2ed7c021c6938c89ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "逃避的话反而输了气势，\n于是就决定接下这个申请。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04dd561e2fa74a3310d7026d6773acae33aae9d022e9957dee1fa0691c06df3f",
